1
00:00:00,796 --> 00:00:05,886
(Sheldon:)...I happened to gaze out the window
and a brassiere caught my eye.

2
00:00:06,302 --> 00:00:08,342
(Sheldon:)Do those look familiar?

3
00:00:08,512 --> 00:00:11,852
(Penny:)How the hell did you get them up
on that telephone wire?

4
00:00:12,016 --> 00:00:16,606
(Sheldon:)When you understand the laws of physics,
Penny, anything is possible.

5
00:00:17,647 --> 00:00:20,607
And may I add:
Mua-ha-ha.

6
00:00:22,693 --> 00:00:24,233
- Get them down.
- Apologize.

7
00:00:24,403 --> 00:00:25,693
(Raj:)- Never.
- Then I suggest...

8
00:00:25,863 --> 00:00:28,243
(Sheldon:)...you get a very long stick
and play panty piñata.

9
00:00:29,992 --> 00:00:31,072
(Penny:)Look, wait, Sheldon.

10
00:00:31,243 --> 00:00:32,913
(Penny:)This has gotten out of hand. Okay.

11
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:35,869
(Penny:)I've done some stupid things,
you've done some stupid things.

12
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,250
How about call it even,
move on with our lives?

13
00:00:38,417 --> 00:00:39,917
(Sheldon:)I've done no stupid things.

14
00:00:40,086 --> 00:00:42,416
- Look, you've gotta meet me halfway here.
- I am.

15
00:00:42,588 --> 00:00:45,428
(Sheldon:)I'm willing to concede that you've
done some stupid things.

16
00:00:47,718 --> 00:00:51,058
(Leonard:)Hey, you guys are talking again. Good.

17
00:00:53,641 --> 00:00:55,351
(Leonard:)What happened?

18
00:00:55,518 --> 00:00:57,438
(Scene:)Leonard,
remember when I said it was on?

19
00:00:57,603 --> 00:01:01,023
(Penny:)Well, now it's junior rodeo on.

